<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資誠今天發布「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020</span>全球女性工作指數報告」，將<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">OECD</span>國家的女性就業率提升至瑞典水準<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">69%</span>，可增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>兆美元的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">GDP</span>。（資誠提供）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">〔記者巫其倫／台北報導〕資誠（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">PwC</span>）今天發布「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020</span>全球女性工作指數報告」（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">PwC Women in Work Index 2020</span>），將<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">OECD</span>國家的女性就業率提升至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">69%</span>，可增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>兆美元的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">GDP</span>；以國家來看，全球女性工作指數排行榜前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>名國家，分別為冰島、瑞典和斯洛維尼亞。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資誠針對<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2017</span>年至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年期間統計，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">OECD</span>國家中，冰島和瑞典已連<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>年分居前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>名，斯洛維尼亞排第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>；至於排名成長幅度最大則為捷克，從第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">23</span>位上升到第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">19</span>位；愛沙尼亞、愛爾蘭排名降幅最大，各下降<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>個名次，主因愛沙尼亞女性全職就業率下降，以及愛爾蘭性別薪資差距擴大。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資誠會計師徐麗珍表示，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">OECD</span>各國女性就業已有進展，但改善速度仍慢，增加女性參與勞動力，將對<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">GDP</span>成長的幫助很大。此外，目前正進入第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>次工業革命，面對自動化科技普及，企業也要確保女性可獲得技能提升機會。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">報告指出，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">OECD</span>國家的女性就業率提升至近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>成，將增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>兆美元的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">GDP</span>；此外，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">OECD</span>國家的性別薪資差距若縮小，也將為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">OECD</span>的女性所得增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>兆美元</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">報告也提到，七大工業國（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">G7</span>）中，女性平均只佔科技勞動力的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">30</span>％，且科技公司女性高階主管人數更少。根據資誠調查，就科技業性別比例和平等而言，加拿大為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">G7</span>中表現最好國家，法國第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>，美國第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>，英國第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">調查也發現，全球超過一半勞工認為，自動化將在未來<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>年內發生重大變化，或導致他們的工作不符合時勢所趨。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資誠人資長林瓊瀛建議，在數位浪潮下，政府和企業必須協助勞工適應科技對工作帶來的變革，包括提升數位技能計畫和<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">STEM</span>（科學、技術、工程、數學）培訓計畫，並提供學習軟技能（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">soft skills</span>）的機會，例如創造力、問題解決能力和靈活性。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 